  "name": "Create UGC product ads with Nano Banana and Veo 3.1 for TikTok, Instagram Reels and Shorts",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "faae759b-f958-431b-a62e-528aa3c2f0f6",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -661,
        -97
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 812,
        "content": "## Turn a product photo into UGC-style ads and post them\nAdd a product and its photo to Google Sheets and get a UGC ad pack: a creator selfie photo for Instagram and Facebook and a talking selfie video for TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every day at 10:00** takes the next row marked ready with a photo link and claims it.\n2. **Write the ad with Gemini** looks at the photo and writes the photo edit, the Veo shot with one spoken line and a caption per network, using only the facts in the row.\n3. **Nano Banana UGC photo** edits the real product photo into a creator selfie; **Post the UGC photo** (PostWire) publishes it on Instagram and Facebook.\n4. **Veo 3.1 UGC clip** renders the 8-second vertical selfie video; **Post the UGC video** publishes it on TikTok, Reels and Shorts.\n5. **Mark the product as posted** writes every link in the row. If a render or a network fails, **Write the fix in the row** and **Email me the fix** say what to fix.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified **PostWire** node (search \"PostWire\" in the nodes panel), create an account at postwire.io, connect your networks and paste your API key into a **PostWire API** credential.\n2. Add a Google Gemini credential to the three Gemini nodes. Nano Banana costs about 0.04 USD per image and Veo 3.1 Fast about 1.20 USD per clip.\n3. Create a sheet with the columns product, photo_url, benefit, audience, status, posted_at, links and note, and pick it in the three Sheets nodes.\n4. Connect Gmail and fill in **Ad settings**.\n\n### Customize\nChange the creator and setting in Ad settings, or the networks in the two PostWire nodes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
